+ version: 1.2.0
+   Intelligent OpenClaw auto-updater with smart scheduling. Automatically checks for updates to both OpenClaw core AND installed skills, analyzes cron schedules to avoid user task windows, waits for system idle time, performs AI-powered impact assessment, sends notifications via configured channels, and ensures gateway restarts smoothly. Use when: (1) Weekly maintenance, (2) User requests update check, (3) Heartbeat health checks, (4) Automated self-maintenance with intelligent timing
+ - **AI Impact Assessment**: Evaluates update risk based on multiple factors
+ - **Smart Notification**: Auto-detects messaging channels and sends reports
+ | NoNotify | switch | false | Skip sending notifications |
+ ## AI Impact Assessment
+ The updater evaluates the following factors to determine update risk:
+ | Factor | Weight | Description |
+ |--------|--------|-------------|
+ | Version Impact | 30% | Major/Minor/Patch level changes |
+ | Skills Count | 25% | Number of skills to update |
+ | Gateway Restart | 20% | Impact of gateway restart |
+ | Time Since Last Update | 15% | How long since last update |
+ | Cron Proximity | 10% | Distance to next scheduled task |
+ **Risk Levels**:
+ - 🟢 **Low**: Patch update, <3 skills, >4 hours since last update
+ - 🟡 **Medium**: Minor update, 3-5 skills, 2-4 hours since last update
+ - 🔴 **High**: Major update, >5 skills, <2 hours since last update
+ ## Smart Notification
+ Automatically detects configured messaging channels from ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json:
+ Supported channels:
+ - **Telegram**: Sends via bot API
+ - **Feishu**: Sends via app API
+ Notification includes:
+ - Update summary (core + skills)
+ - Impact assessment (risk level)
+ - Changes made
+ - Gateway status
+ 6. Performs AI impact assessment
